cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these models or this code, please cite the archived release below."
title: "NeUSBrain-SPRIND: classification, segmentation and vermis-height models for neonatal cranial ultrasound"
abstract: >-
  Inference code and trained model weights for automated analysis of mid-sagittal neonatal cranial
  ultrasound: usable-image classification, mid-sagittal plane classification, skull and
  cerebellum/vermis segmentation (nnU-Net v2), and statistical-shape-model-based vermis height
  measurement.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-15"
license: Apache-2.0
